<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan bank picks 500 mln rupees in operation.</title>
<headline>Pakistan bank picks 500 mln rupees in operation.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State (central) Bank of Pakistan accepted 500 million rupees in a special open market operation in Short-Term Federal Bonds:</p>
<p>			Offered	 Accepted	Max cut-off</p>
<p>Outright sales    4,025	   500	     15.70 percent</p>
<p>Five-month	  1,050	   NIL	     NIL</p>
<p>Three-month	   NIL	   NIL	     NIL</p>
<p>One-month	     NIL	   NIL	     NIL</p>
<p>Total(million rupees) 5,075	   500</p>
<p>($1 = 40.56 rupees) -- Ibrahim Khan 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
